{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"亲切持续带来欢喜，使这一刻越来越珍贵；当他意识到快乐中的片刻正在成为过去时，便开始舍不得它，写出了满足如何生出希望亲近延续的愿望。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"部分\",\n      \"sec\": \"S02、S05、S12\",\n      \"why\": \"稿子写到珍惜使人越来越难保持从容、用力维持快乐以及意识到片刻已经过去，但没有完整说明抓紧当下只会增加自身牵动，却无法为未来的延续提供保证。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"稿子明确写出身体缓下来后期待仍然存在，说明生理上的放松只能减轻身体的紧张，并不能自动解除心里的悬念。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"眼前的激动退去后，记忆中的亲切仍然使他心动，但这种回味同时带上了想回去重体验的感觉，写出了记忆仍有情感回报却不能替代当下亲近的过程。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"invented\": [],\n  \"loops\": [\n    \"S05–S06：先写他用力维持快乐，随后又写他不再急着恢复原先的高兴，转而沉浸于回忆和想念，构成了从维持或恢复当下情绪转向另一种应对方式的链条，但音乐本身不足以证实人物实际尝试过这些策略。\"\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9f0bf36b-ab38-4dd0-942f-6ae46c96853f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T130901079044Z", "elapsed_seconds": 476.578, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:16:57.669509+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a7fc462597ff91ce7fc41a37f0f15fd2192cc8b08b527d80f07434d421730093", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connec